class="math inline">\(a \leftarrow b\)</span>, <span
class="math inline">\(a \leftarrow &gt; b\)</span>, <span
class="math inline">\(a \mapsto b\)</span>, <span
class="math inline">\(a \rightarrowtail b\)</span>, <span
class="math inline">\(a \twoheadrightarrow b\)</span>.</p>
<p>Long arrows: <span class="math inline">\(a \longrightarrow
b\)</span>, <span class="math inline">\(a \longleftarrow b\)</span>,
<span class="math inline">\(a \longleftrightarrow b\)</span>, <span
class="math inline">\(a \Longrightarrow b\)</span>, <span
class="math inline">\(a \Longleftarrow b\)</span>, <span
